# Getting married in Russian: выйти замуж, жениться
subtitle: "Он женится на Лене, она выходит замуж за Ивана, они поженятся: who marries whom in Russian, as Masha's brother gets engaged."
tags: ["russian","выйти замуж","жениться","wedding in russian","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/verb-cases","vocabulary/family"]
thumb: "band \"Getting married in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"A complaint and an apology in Russian: жалоба, извините","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/179-russian-complaint.cast"}

