  lines:
    '|a||Getting married in Russian: выйти замуж, жениться':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5680
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Он женится на Лене, она выходит замуж за Ивана, они поженятся: who marries whom in Russian, as Masha''s brother gets engaged.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:xmiqjc'
    '|a||Февра́ль. Ве́чер, я до́ма. Звони́т Ма́ша, и у неё но́вость.':
