    '|a||Ты приглашён! Tom.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1960
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Что вы услы́шали? Ива́н же́нится. На ком? На Ле́не.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||А Ле́на вы́йдет за него́ за́муж: за Ива́на.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:kfmr2e'
    '|a||Как перевести́ to marry? Two different verbs. A man же́нится на, with the about-form: на Ле́не. A woman выхо́дит за́муж, вы́йдет за́муж, за + the object-form: за Ива́на.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 16000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1ie6qza'
    '|a||И вме́сте, the two of them: они́ поже́нятся в ию́не. Or simply: они́ же́нятся.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1578938'
    '|a||Посмотри́те: она́, он, они́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:yj400z'
    '|a||Вы́йти за́муж, жени́ться, пожени́ться.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1w2a0pa'
    '|a||За кого́? За Ива́на. На ком? На Ле́не.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1ozvp8n'
    '|a||And now married: она́ за́мужем, он жена́т, они́ жена́ты.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:j739sc'
    '|a||За́муж, from муж; жена́т, from жена́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:szicmu'
    '|a||Повтори́те вслух: она́ вы́шла за́муж, она́ за́мужем.':
